	<TextRow
		Label="pw_briefing_001"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Ctrl1:xcenter ]バケモノに　おそわれたが　にげのび
[Ctrl1:xcenter ]ゆうえんちで　たすけを　こう
[Ctrl1:xcenter ]おんなのひとを　すくった　[Name:TrainerName ]</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ito_hiroto:W00178"
				Time="2011-09-27T11:53:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Ctrl1:xcenter ]バケモノに　襲われたが　逃げのび
[Ctrl1:xcenter ]遊園地で　助けを　こう
[Ctrl1:xcenter ]女の人を　救った　[Name:TrainerName ]</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ito_hiroto:W00178"
				Time="2011-09-27T11:53:54" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>あらすじ♂</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-08-02T11:01:23" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="pw_briefing_002"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Ctrl1:xcenter ]あかいきりの　げんいんを
[Ctrl1:xcenter ]さがす　うちに
[Ctrl1:xcenter ]はかばに　たどりついた　[Name:TrainerName ]が
[Ctrl1:xcenter ]めに　した　もの　とは……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ito_hiroto:W00178"
				Time="2011-09-27T11:54:01" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-08-02T10:35:53" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Ctrl1:xcenter ]赤い霧の　原因を
[Ctrl1:xcenter ]探す　うちに
[Ctrl1:xcenter ]墓場に　たどりついた　[Name:TrainerName ]が
[Ctrl1:xcenter ]目に　した　もの　とは……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ito_hiroto:W00178"
				Time="2011-09-27T11:54:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
